# 🛍️ online shopping – E-Commerce Website

A modern and responsive **E-Commerce Web Application** built using Python and Django.
AakashKart allows users to browse products, manage their cart, place orders, and complete the shopping process through a simple and user-friendly interface.

![alt text](image.png)


## 🚀 Features

### 👤 User Features

* User Registration & Login
* User Authentication
* Product Browsing
* Category-based Product Filtering
* Product Details
* Shopping Cart
* Quantity Management
* Order Management
* User-friendly Responsive UI

### 🛒 Shopping Features

* Add Products to Cart
* Update Cart Quantity
* Remove Products from Cart
* Automatic Cart Total Calculation
* Product Categories
* Product Images
* Product Price Display


![alt text](image-1.png)

### 🔐 Admin Features

* Django Admin Panel
* Manage Products
* Manage Categories
* Manage Users
* Manage Orders
* Update Product Information

